{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564970/extras/\uba54\uc778\ud654\uba74_\uc77c\ub7ec\uc2a4\ud2b8.png?t=1744298130\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20XX, and you're living your life as an unemployed bum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After failing the SATs and failing to get into college.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're holed up in the corner of your room watching anime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Communicating with your girlfriends on the monitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You moved to Seoul with your parents smacking you on the back,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I moved to a share house with other people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are told that there are only people who live hard and learn from them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But when you arrive at the share house, there are three pretty girls in the house...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ryu Ji-hyae is an energetic and confident actress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Park Yun-ha, who is mature but has a twisted charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hong Se-un, who is cute and sassy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Story of our life]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Welcome, Sharehouse&quot; is a comedic look at the struggles of 20-somethings in the modern world. As you  move in together with these three roommates... together, you try to figure out on your, and their future.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[High-quality illustrations].</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The illustrations are drawn in great detail, focusing on the points that you will find appealing. Enjoy what it's like to live with these cute characters!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Intuitive interface to make gaming easier and more enjoyable].</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>To make the game as easy and appealing as possible, we've designed the interface to be as intuitive and user-friendly as possible, so you and your roommates can focus on your romance with the characters.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564970/extras/SH_1.png?t=1744298130\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564970/extras/SH_2a.png?t=1744298130\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564970/extras/SH_3.png?t=1744298130\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564970?t=1744298130","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564970/92aa323e05f4da4edef735a8d5f6c59711ea697e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744298130","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564970/a623a46906371229e9d85f9f77f748945e8d6ef6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744298130","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564970/a623a46906371229e9d85f9f77f748945e8d6ef6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744298130","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564970/extras/\uba